        "asthira hoilo mati"
      ],
      "translation": "The burden of family life increased day by day, and under its weight I felt my personal progress in life forcibly come to a halt. Old age came and beleaguered me on all sides, making my mind incessantly disturbed.",
      "deva": [
        "संसारेर भार, बाडे दिने दिने,",
        "अचल होइलो गति",
        "बार्धक्य आसिया, घेरिलो आमारे,",
        "अस्थिर होइलो मति"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "সংসারের ভার, বাডে দিনে দিনে,",
        "অচল হোইলো গতি",
        "বার্ধক্য আসিযা, ঘেরিলো আমারে,",
        "অস্থির হোইলো মতি"
